<article class="env-lemma" id="064B">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/064B">Lemma <span data-tag="064B">13.19.8</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{A}$ be an abelian category. Let $P^\bullet $ be bounded above complex consisting of projective objects. Let $L^\bullet \in K(\mathcal{A})$. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \mathop{\mathrm{Mor}}\nolimits _{K(\mathcal{A})}(P^\bullet , L^\bullet ) = \mathop{\mathrm{Mor}}\nolimits _{D(\mathcal{A})}(P^\bullet , L^\bullet ).  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Dual to Lemma <a href="/tag/05TG" data-tag="05TG">13.18.8</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>